From Eq. (i), it follows that the slope of the graph is $\frac{h}{e}$. Therefore,

\begin{aligned}
h=e \times \text { slope } & =1.6 \times 10^{-19} \times \frac{165-0}{(8-4) \times 10^{15}} \\
